Increase management interface command buffer from 1024 to 65536 bytes.

AWS Client VPN SAML CRV1 authentication sends the SAML assertion (~12KB)
as a management password command. The default 1024-byte command buffer
truncates the command, causing "unknown command" errors.

This patch is version-agnostic — the line `command_line_new(1024)` is
unchanged in both OpenVPN 2.6.x and 2.7.x.

diff --git a/src/openvpn/manage.c b/src/openvpn/manage.c
--- a/src/openvpn/manage.c
+++ b/src/openvpn/manage.c
@@ -2592,7 +2592,7 @@
          * command output from/to the socket.
          */
-        man->connection.in = command_line_new(1024);
+        man->connection.in = command_line_new(65536);
         man->connection.out = buffer_list_new();
 
